      "requiresE2E": true,
      "reason": "Table Tilt furnishing and mounted-asset inputs select their registered-scene visibility proof, geometry/optics and task consumers, plus the public browser flow. A mounted-camera height mutation is detected, but an exploratory sideboard horizontal-anchor mutation survived; until that furnishing position has an independent reference, this owner cannot alone establish complete coverage. Scene-tree changes also retain the separate incomplete scene-implementation owner."
    },
    {
      "id": "webgpu-lifecycle",
      "label": "WebGPU adapter and runtime contracts",
      "paths": ["src/render/webgpu/**"],
      "tests": [
        "src/tests/unit/groundGlassWebGpuRuntime.test.ts",
        "src/tests/unit/groundGlassWebGpuOpticalStateAdapter.test.ts",
        "src/tests/unit/groundGlassWebGpuTestSeam.test.ts",
